# flutter_input_kit

- Public export only via `lib/flutter_input_kit.dart`.
- Validators return error codes, never translated strings or slang.
- Labels / errorText at the call site only.
- Path-depend on sibling core, page, scale, and theme kits.
- Use `fvm flutter` (pin 3.35.7). Never upgrade the shared SDK.
- No dio, supabase, firebase, drift, or riverpod in `lib/`.
- Do not start data_kit / nav_kit / app_kit unless asked.
